# Allowlist, not denylist. The Dockerfile copies only go.mod, go.sum and
# main.go, but everything else in this directory is still uploaded to the
# daemon as build context — and config.yml holds the webhook bearer secrets.
# Denying by default means a secret cannot reach a build layer, a remote
# builder or an image-history dump even if a COPY is added carelessly later.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!main.go
